  "prefLabel": "Ac 501.03 Applicability to Indirect Services",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 501.03 Applicability to Indirect Services. A licensee shall not permit others to carry out on their behalf, either with or without compensation, acts which, if carried out by the licensee, would place the licensee in violation of the rules.\n\nSource. #9051, eff 12-27-07; ss by #10746, eff 1-1-15; ss by #14188, eff 4-5-25 (formerly Ac 501.04)",
